    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DRIFT!\u00a0</i> Your way around <strong>40+ Race Courses</strong>\u00a0and hours of chaotic\u00a0<strong>Story Mode </strong>levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BOOM!\u00a0</i> Use your winnings to <strong>Purchase Upgrades</strong>, Weapons, and precious Ammunition </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BOOM!</i>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Crash and shoot</strong> anyone who gets in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Retro Cars</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each car sports <strong>Distinct Handling</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/8644666203ca876d013b3370e8b26376.avif?t=1746679837\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Eurobeat Soundtrack</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licensed Songs</strong> from multiple continents.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Splitscreen Racing &amp; Co-Op</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1-4 players in all game modes.\u00a0 <strong>Cooperate or Compete</strong> with your friends &amp; family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.poster.avif?t=1746679837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.webm?t=1746679837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.mp4?t=1746679837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Story Mode</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a rookie Agent assigned to dismantle a crime ring in a small rural town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore town, make friends, and <strong>Catch the Scum Lord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/0c689f99d6bd60fd45e3a4ad05cee9dd.avif?t=1746679837\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Tight Controls</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple enough to <strong>Pick Up &amp; Play</strong>.\u00a0 Deep enough to reward skilled maneuvers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.poster.avif?t=1746679837\" width=668 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.webm?t=1746679837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.mp4?t=1746679837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DRIFT!\u00a0</i> Your way around <strong>40+ Race Courses</strong>\u00a0and hours of chaotic\u00a0<strong>Story Mode </strong>levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BOOM!\u00a0</i> Use your winnings to <strong>Purchase Upgrades</strong>, Weapons, and precious Ammunition </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BOOM!</i>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Crash and shoot</strong> anyone who gets in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Retro Cars</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each car sports <strong>Distinct Handling</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/8644666203ca876d013b3370e8b26376.avif?t=1746679837\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Eurobeat Soundtrack</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licensed Songs</strong> from multiple continents.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Splitscreen Racing &amp; Co-Op</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1-4 players in all game modes.\u00a0 <strong>Cooperate or Compete</strong> with your friends &amp; family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.poster.avif?t=1746679837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.webm?t=1746679837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/d9f157cb89e0cca0b0edbc39e06d9696.mp4?t=1746679837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Story Mode</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a rookie Agent assigned to dismantle a crime ring in a small rural town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore town, make friends, and <strong>Catch the Scum Lord</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/0c689f99d6bd60fd45e3a4ad05cee9dd.avif?t=1746679837\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Tight Controls</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple enough to <strong>Pick Up &amp; Play</strong>.\u00a0 Deep enough to reward skilled maneuvers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.poster.avif?t=1746679837\" width=668 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.webm?t=1746679837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826510/extras/98d5c2086d447752f4f030bc21b0199a.mp4?t=1746679837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udca5</h2>",
